Locality time-zone data is derived from GeoNames cities15000, downloaded November 8, 2026.
Source: https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/cities15000.zip
Attribution: GeoNames, https://www.geonames.org/
License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Stardust transforms the source into normalized locality names with country/state
disambiguation and IANA time-zone identifiers. Coordinates, population, identifiers
and other source columns are omitted. The source is provided without a warranty of
accuracy, timeliness or completeness. This notice applies to the generated data;
the application's own code is licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
